The Solar Leads Client board had 13 opportunities titled literally
'there' in one 100-card sample. Cause: make_call() defaults name='there'
and on inbound calls with no caller ID that string was passed straight
through to ghl_create_opportunity.

12 of the 13 were tagged 'inbound call' - people ringing the Denver
number back, which is the warmest lead there is, sitting unnamed and
unworked in New Lead.

opportunity_display_name() falls back real name -> formatted phone ->
'New Lead', and ghl_create_opportunity refuses a placeholder as a last
line of defence.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
